  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Partnership Initiative for Ghana and West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will leverage on its previous works to advance the objectives of ensuring Just Societies, Climate Justice, while creating safe spaces that guarantee Gender Justice and social inclusion  - leaving no one behind. The project will work to guarantee the fulfilment of citizens&apos; rights to transparency and accountability on the utilization of public funds including fiscal accountability involving both public revenues &#x2013; collected through a progressive tax system  - and public expenditure &#x2013; through a transparent and accountable budget cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
